  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0152 · DateRangeFilter (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface — the native peers of the web `t(key, default)` keys
  in `components/forms/DateRangeFilter.tsx`. Every key/fallback pair below is byte-identical to the web source
